{"3298340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lunar Corps®", "steam_appid": 3298340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SOLAR EVACUATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The year is 2656. Our solar system is dying as the Sun undergoes a premature expansion, turning entire worlds into burning wastelands. Humanity’s final ships have begun their exodus to our new star system: Arcadia. Meanwhile, our military force—the Lunar Corps—has established fortified firebases and outposts ready for their arrival.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298340/extras/f384511db77d55b5bd324eceac97c838.avif?t=1783622669\" width=1560 height=876 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPERATION BLACKOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now, something is wrong. Outposts have gone silent, firebases are in lockdown and multiple squadrons are missing without a trace. A mysterious threat is spreading across the frontier, dismantling humanity’s foothold before it can take root.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298340/extras/0f792c1ef24cf99f838383478e8bf18b.avif?t=1783622669\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunar Corps blends fast-paced first-person combat with tactical skirmishes across hostile alien environments. Explore abandoned firebases, uncover clues, reclaim territory, and push back the threat spreading across Arcadia. Battle alone or with up to three allies in a tight four-player co-op experience designed for quick action and strategic teamwork.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298340/extras/57d78a1a644795705d752c0f0603eabe.avif?t=1783622669\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Cooperative Action</strong> – Team up with friends or go solo as you fight through dynamic missions and enemy incursions.<br><br><strong>Firebase Restoration</strong> – Reactivate outposts, rebuild defences, and regain control of Arcadia’s frontier one sector at a time.<br><br><strong>Tactical First-Person Combat</strong> – Choose loadouts, coordinate roles, and engage in fast, responsive firefights across hostile terrain.<br><br><strong>Frontier Exploration</strong> – Search derelict sites, track missing squads, and uncover the origins of the mysterious threat.<br><br><strong>Progression &amp; Gear Upgrades</strong> – Improve your equipment, unlock abilities, and build your perfect soldier.<br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MATURE CONTENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game may contain content that is not suitable for all ages or for viewing in the workplace, including frequent violence, gore, and general mature themes.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SOLAR EVACUATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The year is 2656. Our solar system is dying as the Sun undergoes a premature expansion, turning entire worlds into burning wastelands. Humanity’s final ships have begun their exodus to our new star system: Arcadia. Meanwhile, our military force—the Lunar Corps—has established fortified firebases and outposts ready for their arrival.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298340/extras/f384511db77d55b5bd324eceac97c838.avif?t=1783622669\" width=1560 height=876 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPERATION BLACKOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now, something is wrong. Outposts have gone silent, firebases are in lockdown and multiple squadrons are missing without a trace. A mysterious threat is spreading across the frontier, dismantling humanity’s foothold before it can take root.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298340/extras/0f792c1ef24cf99f838383478e8bf18b.avif?t=1783622669\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunar Corps blends fast-paced first-person combat with tactical skirmishes across hostile alien environments. Explore abandoned firebases, uncover clues, reclaim territory, and push back the threat spreading across Arcadia. Battle alone or with up to three allies in a tight four-player co-op experience designed for quick action and strategic teamwork.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298340/extras/57d78a1a644795705d752c0f0603eabe.avif?t=1783622669\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Cooperative Action</strong> – Team up with friends or go solo as you fight through dynamic missions and enemy incursions.<br><br><strong>Firebase Restoration</strong> – Reactivate outposts, rebuild defences, and regain control of Arcadia’s frontier one sector at a time.<br><br><strong>Tactical First-Person Combat</strong> – Choose loadouts, coordinate roles, and engage in fast, responsive firefights across hostile terrain.<br><br><strong>Frontier Exploration</strong> – Search derelict sites, track missing squads, and uncover the origins of the mysterious threat.<br><br><strong>Progression &amp; Gear Upgrades</strong> – Improve your equipment, unlock abilities, and build your perfect soldier.<br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MATURE CONTENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game may contain content that is not suitable for all ages or for viewing in the workplace, including frequent violence, gore, and general mature themes.</p>", "short_description": "Humanity’s Sun is destabilising. Worlds are on fire. A Solar-wide evacuation has begun. Earth’s military force—The Lunar Corps—prepares the colonisation of our new star system: Arcadia. But rising distress calls and radio silence hint at an unseen enemy lurking in the shadows...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298340/7d24f8ee8316c404e4a28775270987eab02185e0/header.jpg?t=1783622669", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298340/fbe96eb99536c4a3a003c19331b1c0b223d61819/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783622669", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298340/fbe96eb99536c4a3a003c19331b1c0b223d61819/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783622669", "website": "https://www.FlareGunStudios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> CPU: AMD Ryzen 5 5500 / Intel Core i5-11400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT /  NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required. Designed for Low–Medium graphics settings.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> CPU: AMD Ryzen 7 5800X / Intel Core i7-12700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 7600 XT /  NVI